sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant PAY as 支付App
    participant ACC as PaymentAccessibilityService
    participant NL as PaymentNotificationListenerService
    participant CC as CaptureCoordinator
    participant MP as ScreenCaptureManager
    participant OCR as OcrEngine+FieldExtractor
    participant RE as ClassificationRuleEngine
    participant CF as ConfidenceCalculator
    participant VC as VerificationController
    participant DD as DuplicateDetector
    participant Repo as BillRepository
    participant UI as UI 弹窗

    U->>PAY: 完成付款
    PAY-->>ACC: WINDOW_CONTENT_CHANGED(支付结果页)
    PAY-->>NL: 支付成功通知
    alt 无障碍已授权且命中完成态关键词
        ACC->>ACC: 1.5s去抖 + 节点文本抽取
        ACC->>CC: CaptureEvent(ACCESSIBILITY_TEXT, 文本)
    else 通知使用权已授权
        NL->>NL: 包名+关键词过滤 + 正则解析
        NL->>CC: CaptureEvent(NOTIFICATION, 文本)
    end
    opt 截屏备选已开启且已授权
        CC->>MP: capture()
        MP-->>CC: 加密截图路径
    end
    CC->>OCR: 预处理 + OCR + 字段抽取
    OCR-->>CC: OcrResult(amountFen, merchant, billTime, rawText, ocrConfidence)
    CC->>RE: classify(merchant, rawText)
    RE-->>CC: categoryId/accountId + ruleHit
    CC->>CF: calculate(result, fields, ruleHit)
    CF-->>CC: finalScore
    CC->>DD: isDuplicate(buildKey)
    alt 重复（双路捕获同一笔）
        DD-->>CC: true → 丢弃，markConsumed
    else 字段齐全且 finalScore >= 阈值
        CC->>Repo: addWithBalanceTx(auto_capture, auto_passed)
        Repo-->>UI: 余额/列表刷新
    else 字段缺失或 finalScore < 阈值
        CC->>VC: requestVerify(candidate)
        alt App 前台
            VC->>UI: Compose Dialog
        else 后台且悬浮窗授权
            VC->>UI: SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW 悬浮窗
        else 锁屏 / 无悬浮窗
            VC->>UI: 高优先级通知(锁屏可见)
        end
        UI-->>VC: 用户确认 / 改写
        VC->>Repo: addWithBalanceTx(verify=user_confirmed/corrected)
    end
